[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- name;[m
[32m+[m[32m- role;[m
[32m+[m[32m- branch;[m
[32m+[m[32m- workspace;[m
[32m+[m[32m- ownership;[m
[32m+[m[32m- responsibilities;[m
[32m+[m[32m- restrictions;[m
[32m+[m[32m- verification responsibilities.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe new agent must read this file and all relevant project documentation before making changes.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 19. No Guessing Rule[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIf requirements are ambiguous, an agent must not invent critical business rules.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt must:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. inspect existing specifications;[m
[32m+[m[32m2. inspect architecture decisions;[m
[32m+[m[32m3. document the ambiguity;[m
[32m+[m[32m4. choose the safest reversible option when possible;[m
[32m+[m[32m5. record the decision.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
