[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m"Code written" does not mean "task completed."[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCompletion means:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIMPLEMENTED → TESTED → VERIFIED → DOCUMENTED → COMMITTED[m
[32m+[m
